00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:16,280
你猜怎么着
Guess what.

341
00:14:16,400 --> 00:14:18,060
艾希莉刚把我们的名片给了个女人
Ashley just gave our card to a woman

342
00:14:18,060 --> 00:14:20,160
她拽得跟二五八万一样 肯定是号人物
who's such a bitch she must be important.

343
00:14:20,940 --> 00:14:22,140
她是个美食博客写手
She's a food blogger.

344
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:22,980
虽然希望渺茫
It's a long shot,

345
00:14:22,980 --> 00:14:24,336
但是我们真的需要打响招牌
but we need to get some exposure.

346
00:14:24,336 --> 00:14:26,600
我们不是在放假吗
Whoa, we are on vacation.

347
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:28,560
说好了不谈公事的 还记得吗
No business talk. That was the deal, right?

348
00:14:29,400 --> 00:14:32,680
他是齐克 厨师/作家/为五斗米折腰的男人
This is Zeke, chef-slash- author-slash-corporate sellout.

349
00:14:33,160 --> 00:14:34,700
我们...
We were, uh...

350
00:14:35,620 --> 00:14:38,160
我们刚想回公寓玩会儿呢
We were thinking about going back to the apartment to hang out.

351
00:14:38,500 --> 00:14:39,720
感觉挺有意思啊
Oh, sounds fun.

352
00:14:39,980 --> 00:14:41,200
我能单独跟你谈两句吗
Can I see you alone for a second?

353
00:14:41,500 --> 00:14:42,480
没办法单独
Well, not alone.

354
00:14:42,580 --> 00:14:44,620
老娘狗不离身 怎么着
I bring my tiny dog everywhere, so what?

355
00:14:46,120 --> 00:14:48,560
我听他们说要去苏豪区办庆功宴
Come on, I heard of an after-party in Soho

356
00:14:48,560 --> 00:14:50,240
再到登波区办庆功宴的庆功宴
and an after-after-party in dumbo.

357
00:14:50,420 --> 00:14:51,560
咱们就去"舒好"吧
So, let's go-ho.

358
00:14:51,740 --> 00:14:53,760
大玩特玩 让假期真正开始
Have fun and get this vacation started.

359
00:14:54,400 --> 00:14:56,840
我抱着小狗在一个培根食谱的派对上
I'm holding a tiny dog at a bacon-book party

360
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:59,060
跟一个写培根书的男人有说有笑
and laughing with a guy who wrote a book about bacon.

361
00:14:59,300 --> 00:15:01,260
我的假期早就开始了
I think my vacation's already started.

362
00:15:02,460 --> 00:15:03,760
好吧 那你自己玩的开心点
All right, well, have fun.

363
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:04,640
我要去派对一番啦
I'm gonna go par-tay.

364
00:15:05,659 --> 00:15:07,289
小艾艾 想干嘛就去吧
Eh, did your thing, Ash.

365
00:15:14,620 --> 00:15:16,360
我不想说我炙手可热
I don't want to say that I'm hot.

366
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:18,420
但我兜里的"培根"已经熟了
But the bacon in my pocket is done.

367
00:15:19,980 --> 00:15:22,320
说好五分钟一换的 你们俩混蛋
We said turns were five minutes, you bastards.

368
00:15:23,840 --> 00:15:25,780
你们好 在享受桑拿吗
Oh, hi. More sauna fun.

369
00:15:26,240 --> 00:15:27,880
麦克斯 能出来说句话吗
Max, can I see you in the hall for a second?

370
00:15:28,120 --> 00:15:29,780
但该到我蒸蒸我这两球了呢
But it's my turn to sweat my balls off.

371
00:15:31,540 --> 00:15:33,640
别以为我出去了 就不给你们计时了
Don't think the clock's not running while I'm out there.

372
00:15:35,220 --> 00:15:37,300
我们能去度个真正的假期了
We're going on a real vacation.

373
00:15:37,400 --> 00:15:38,700
你打包行李的速度能有多快
How quickly can you pack a bag?

374
00:15:38,740 --> 00:15:40,380
不用担心没有合适的晚礼服
And don't worry about appropriate evening wear.

375
00:15:40,400 --> 00:15:41,860
四季酒店的大厅里
Every Four Seasons has a Gucci

376
00:15:41,860 --> 00:15:43,260
都有古琦跟宝格丽的专卖店
near the Bulgari store in the lobby.

377
00:15:43,820 --> 00:15:46,040
完全听不懂那些字眼
None of those words made any sense.

378
00:15:46,220 --> 00:15:47,960
你是不是春假中风发作了
I think you've had a spring break stroke.

379
00:15:48,420 --> 00:15:50,700
我不是闹着玩的 楼下有车等着我们
No, seriously, there's a car waiting downstairs

380
00:15:50,700 --> 00:15:52,060
要载我们去搭私人飞机呢
to take us to a private plane.

381
00:15:52,300 --> 00:15:53,800
坐车到机场只需要20分钟
We can be at Teterboro in 20 minutes

382
00:15:53,800 --> 00:15:55,000
然后飞8小时就能到大溪地了
and Tahiti in 8 hours.

383
00:15:55,100 --> 00:15:56,740
一切费用 那个希腊人全包
The Greek is paying for everything.

384
00:15:57,760 --> 00:15:59,300
他们喂你吃了什么药
What did they give you?

385
00:15:59,400 --> 00:16:01,400
你能记得的最后一件事是什么
What's the last thing you can remember?

386
00:16:02,300 --> 00:16:02,780
不是啦
Nothing.

387
00:16:03,160 --> 00:16:04,180
我就喝了点水晶香槟
I just had some cristal.

388
00:16:04,505 --> 00:16:06,201
是水晶冰毒吧
Some cristal meth?

389
00:16:07,040 --> 00:16:09,140
不是啦 我只是挺兴奋的
No, I'm just really excited.

390
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:11,760
我在庆功宴上碰到这个船运大亨
I went to the after-party and this shipping magnate.

391
00:16:11,760 --> 00:16:13,420
别担心 不是卖肉傍大款
Don't worry, it's not gonna be sexual.

392
00:16:13,520 --> 00:16:14,480
而是干爹情
More like a father thing.

393
00:16:15,220 --> 00:16:17,860
就跟我走嘛 能好好度假了
Anyway, let's go... finally got us a good vacation.

394
00:16:17,980 --> 00:16:19,560
我们已经有个好假期了啊
But we're having a good vacation.

395
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:21,640
麦克斯 恕我直言
Max, don't take this personally,

396
00:16:21,640 --> 00:16:23,320
但你根本不懂好假期的定义
but you don't know what a good vacation is

397
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:24,660
你一生坐井观天 犹如井底之蛙
because you've never been anywhere.

398
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:26,820
走进这间公寓时
I mean, you walked into that apartment

399
00:16:26,820 --> 00:16:30,040
你都能眼神一亮 好像这是皇宫
and your face lit up, like... like it was amazing.

400
00:16:30,080 --> 00:16:32,140
这单纯只是因为你见识的好东西太少了
And that's because you don't know that it's not.

401
00:16:32,520 --> 00:16:34,620
相信我 我周游过列国
Trust me. I've been everywhere.

402
00:16:34,680 --> 00:16:38,060
我很肯定的告诉你 这里的假期烂爆了
And I'm telling you, this is the worst vacation ever.

403
00:16:38,820 --> 00:16:41,460
甩了培根怪胎跟酿酒兄吧
So let's ditch the bacon freak and the beer bro,

404
00:16:41,800 --> 00:16:44,380
我们搭上飞机 去享受海滩一日游
get on that plane, spend one great day at the beach,

405
00:16:44,380 --> 00:16:46,500
然后回来过一小时8块的生活
and then come back and make $8 an hour.

406
00:16:46,780 --> 00:16:47,660
听起来不错
That sounds fun.

407
00:16:47,820 --> 00:16:49,960
不过你少说了 我们被绑架后
You kind of skipped over the part where we get abducted

408
00:16:49,960 --> 00:16:51,940
南希·格蕾丝的节目会花一年
and Nancy Grace covers the year-long search

409
00:16:51,940 --> 00:16:52,620
来协寻我们的尸首
for our bodies.

410
00:16:54,160 --> 00:16:56,660
应该是康斯坦丁打来了 他等的不耐烦了吧
It must be Constantine. He's gonna be upset.

411
00:16:56,720 --> 00:16:57,980
希腊人最讨厌等待
You never keep a Greek waiting.

412
00:16:59,200 --> 00:17:00,880
天啊 麦克斯 我们收到封邮件
Oh, my God, Max, we just got an email

413
00:17:00,880 --> 00:17:03,220
是今天的美食博客写手发的
on our website from that food blogger at the book party.

414
00:17:03,480 --> 00:17:05,760
她说明早给她送4个小蛋糕过去
She said if we drop off four cupcakes by tomorrow morning,

415
00:17:05,760 --> 00:17:08,280
她就考虑在她的美食博客上美言几句
she'll consider writing about them for her column that day.

416
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:10,740
左右为难啊 要当卡洛琳还是艾希莉呢
Well, what's it gonna be, Caroline or Ashley?

417
00:17:11,140 --> 00:17:13,120
小蛋糕还是大溪地 你挑吧
Cupcakes or Tahiti? Your call.

418
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:16,260
那个希腊人还在等吗
Is the Greek still waiting?

419
00:17:16,640 --> 00:17:17,700
刚开走
He just pulled away.

420
00:17:18,120 --> 00:17:20,660
有空他会回来找我的吧
I'm sure he'll come back here for Ashley sometime.

421
00:17:20,740 --> 00:17:22,620
不过等他回来 我也不想当艾希莉
And when that happens, I wouldn't want to be her.

422
00:17:23,400 --> 00:17:25,240
明天过后 你就被打回原形了
Well, after tomorrow, you won't be.

423
00:17:25,860 --> 00:17:26,820
我能怎么办啊
What can I do?

424
00:17:27,260 --> 00:17:28,900
你是问 当你的两种人格相遇
You mean after your two personalities

425
00:17:28,900 --> 00:17:30,080
并自相残杀 该怎么办吗
meet and kill each other?

426
00:17:30,920 --> 00:17:32,640
麦克斯 我说过我需要放个假
Max, I told you I needed a break.

427
00:17:32,640 --> 00:17:34,660
只是没想到一放假 我就精神分裂
I just didn't know it was gonna be a psychotic one.

428
00:17:35,260 --> 00:17:36,620
你真的要冷静一下了
You really need to chill.

429
00:17:36,800 --> 00:17:37,840
你总是动不动就崩溃
You can't keep freaking out

430
00:17:37,840 --> 00:17:39,340
就因为天不从人愿
because you're not where you want to be...

431
00:17:39,560 --> 00:17:41,300
事不从你心
on vacation or in our business.

432
00:17:41,660 --> 00:17:43,700
人生就是如此 别总是期望太高
I mean, it's life. Lower your expectations.

433
00:17:44,800 --> 00:17:46,760
这个家酿啤酒还挺不错的呢
This microbrew is actually really good.

434
00:17:47,120 --> 00:17:48,200
混入面粉中更美味
Tastes better in the batter.

435
00:17:48,700 --> 00:17:50,660
帮我把那些枫蜜培根弄碎
Hey, crumble up some of that maple bacon for me.

436
00:17:51,700 --> 00:17:53,160
说那些话真是对不起
Sorry about that stuff I said

437
00:17:53,160 --> 00:17:54,600
我不是故意说你是井底之蛙的
about you never having gone anywhere.

438
00:17:54,960 --> 00:17:56,880
干嘛道歉 我的确是井底之蛙
Why? I never have gone anywhere

439
00:17:56,880 --> 00:17:57,660
坐井观天
or done anything.

440
00:17:57,840 --> 00:17:59,980
我觉得我这样其实也不错
And now I'm thinking that's kind of a good thing,

441
00:17:59,980 --> 00:18:02,340
至少我看见新事物还能兴奋
because I can still get excited and make a face

442
00:18:02,340 --> 00:18:03,640
还能惊讶地合不拢嘴
when something's new to me.

443
00:18:04,160 --> 00:18:05,280
因为对我来说 一切都是新事物
'Cause, basically, everything is.

444
00:18:05,420 --> 00:18:06,860
这感觉一定很好吧
That must be nice.

445
00:18:07,400 --> 00:18:10,380
来吧 试吃一下
All right, here, taste it.

446
00:18:10,500 --> 00:18:13,180
混酒面粉加枫蜜培根的特制春假小蛋糕
My beer-batter, maple bacon, spring break cupcake.

447
00:18:16,640 --> 00:18:19,540
天啊 你脸上有"新事物"的表情
Oh, my God, you made the "something new" face.

448
00:18:20,400 --> 00:18:23,100
没错 因为是你创造了新事物
I did, because you made something new.

449
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:25,640
-太好吃了 -再做一次那表情
- It's delicious. - Do the face again.

450
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:36,400
回来啦 环游世界姐妹花
Oh, there they are, the world travelers.

451
00:18:36,940 --> 00:18:38,920
大家怎么还不起身鼓掌撒花啊
Shouldn't people be throwing confetti or something?

452
00:18:39,220 --> 00:18:39,880
我的花都用光了
I'm all out.

453
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:42,540
65年大停电的时候我当毒品吸掉了
I snorted mine in the power outage of '65.

454
00:18:44,540 --> 00:18:45,740
假期玩得开心吗
How was your vacation?

455
00:18:46,120 --> 00:18:47,620
虽然假期后来变成了一日游
Well, it turned out to be more of a daycation,

456
00:18:48,320 --> 00:18:50,000
不过我们还是玩得很开心 对吧
but we had a great time, didn't we, Max?

457
00:18:50,080 --> 00:18:50,840
是挺开心的
Yes, we did.

458
00:18:51,436 --> 00:18:53,638
麦克斯 你走了之后餐厅了无生气啊
Max, things sure are dull around here without you.

459
00:18:53,638 --> 00:18:55,409
周围的人嘴巴都干净得很
Everyone walking around all P.C.,

460
00:18:55,740 --> 00:18:57,560
他娘的 都没人叫我黑鬼了
nobody called me black. Hell.

461
00:18:59,340 --> 00:19:01,400
你走后我都没离开店过呢
I haven't left once since you've been gone.

462
00:19:01,400 --> 00:19:04,560
工作上 你就是我的假期
When it comes to this job, you are my vacation.

463
00:19:06,520 --> 00:19:08,040
就知道你这么好
And that, Earl, is why I got

464
00:19:08,040 --> 00:19:09,960
所以给你带了五个礼物包
all five of these gift bags for you.

465
00:19:13,760 --> 00:19:15,920
欢迎再次光临威廉斯堡餐厅
Welcome, again, to the Williamsburg diner.

466
00:19:16,140 --> 00:19:17,300
这边请
This way, please.

467
00:19:17,960 --> 00:19:21,060
我去维基百科查了"密柜中人"跟"米后"了
I have looked up "down-low" and "rice queen" on Wikipedia.

468
00:19:21,780 --> 00:19:24,300
我不是未出柜的同性恋
And, no, I'm not a secret homosexual

469
00:19:24,300 --> 00:19:26,320
对亚洲男人也没有特殊的基情
or a man who chases only Asian men.

470
00:19:26,940 --> 00:19:29,540
我很好 我很"直" 接受现实吧
I'm great, I'm straight. Get used to it.

471
00:19:31,600 --> 00:19:33,540
你们俩假期过得如何啊
Hi, guys. How was your vacation?

472
00:19:33,840 --> 00:19:35,500
很好啊 你们在我们家玩的开心吗
Great. Did you have fun at our place?

473
00:19:35,780 --> 00:19:37,500
当当然 你们家的桑拿爽歪了
Totes. Your saunas are sick.

474
00:19:37,680 --> 00:19:39,300
我懂 基爆了对吧
I know. Could they be any gayer?

475
00:19:41,340 --> 00:19:41,820
不是啦
No.

476
00:19:43,220 --> 00:19:45,840
不过那天帮维诺娜清肛门腺后
Just one thing. Wynonna's still a little upset

477
00:19:45,840 --> 00:19:47,180
她还一直心情低落呢
about the anal gland event.

478
00:19:47,700 --> 00:19:48,160
什么
What?

479
00:19:48,800 --> 00:19:51,080
我说了她不会懂我们是闹着玩的
I told you she wouldn't know it was a joke.

480
00:19:55,520 --> 00:19:58,000
她怎么会不懂我们是闹着玩的呢
How could she not know it was a joke?

481
00:19:58,340 --> 00:20:00,600
谁会叫别人去挤狗的肛门啊
I mean, who would ask someone to squeeze their dog's pooper?

482
00:20:02,300 --> 00:20:03,640
我们再多付你50吧
We're paying you another 50.

483
00:20:04,480 --> 00:20:06,459
兄弟 她插入你家小狗菊花的深度
Dude, she went second knuckle deep

484
00:20:06,459 --> 00:20:10,244
有两个指节呢 你就多给50块而已啊
in your beagle's back door for only another 50?

485
00:20:12,400 --> 00:20:13,360
谢了
Thank you.

486
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:15,540
还有件事
And just one other thing.

487
00:20:15,540 --> 00:20:17,740
其实我们的生意挺惨淡的
Our business is actually not that great right now,

488
00:20:17,740 --> 00:20:19,440
如果你们能帮忙介绍给朋友
so if you could recommend us to any of your friends,

489
00:20:19,440 --> 00:20:21,200
-我们会感激不尽 -够诚实
- that would really help. - Good for you.

490
00:20:21,480 --> 00:20:23,560
博客一宣传 生意就会蒸蒸日上了吧
I'm sure business will pick up after that blog blurb.

491
00:20:24,100 --> 00:20:26,320
-什么博客宣传 -宣传你们的混酒面粉
- Wait, blog blurb? - About your beer-battered

492
00:20:26,660 --> 00:20:27,920
加枫蜜培根特制春假小蛋糕啊
maple bacon spring break cupcake.

493
00:20:28,040 --> 00:20:29,180
我们都在网上看到了
We just read about it.

494
00:20:29,280 --> 00:20:30,880
是啊 就是那美食贱货的博客
Yeah, in that foodie bitch's blog.

495
00:20:31,812 --> 00:20:33,080
麦克斯 成功了
Max, it worked.

496
00:20:33,080 --> 00:20:34,700
快去用阿憨的电脑看看那篇博客吧
Let's go look at the blog on Han's computer.

497
00:20:35,080 --> 00:20:36,380
失陪一下 我们马上回来
Excuse us. We'll be right back.

498
00:20:37,000 --> 00:20:38,900
刚放完小假 立马有大突破啊
We got a little break and a big break.

499
00:20:48,480 --> 00:20:50,140
是的 我又堕落了一次
Yeah, I did it again.

500
00:20:58,860 --> 00:20:59,660
欢迎回来
Welcome back.

501
00:21:00,280 --> 00:21:02,640
你们错过了我人生中最美妙的两天
You missed the best two days of my life.
